{"assets":["/statement-assets/c1d2fb39e30c1f63dd0ebb21484839007a06091ede0f08eea7b44320314824d1.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2114","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Kirei Attacks the Estate"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Once, Kirei stealthily infiltrated the trap-filled estate of the Ainzbern family but was discovered by Kiritugu's familiar. Assessing his strength, Kirei decided to retreat. The estate is represented as a tree with $$$n$$$ vertices, with the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"root"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" at vertex $$$1$$$. Each vertex of the tree has a number $$$a_i$$$ recorded, which represents the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"danger"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of vertex $$$i$$$. Recall that a tree is a connected undirected graph without cycles."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For a successful retreat, Kirei must compute the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"threat"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" value for each vertex. The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"threat"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of a vertex is equal to the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"maximum"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"alternating"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sum along the vertical path starting from that vertex. The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"alternating"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sum along the vertical path starting from vertex $$$i$$$ is defined as $$$a_i - a_{p_i} + a_{p_{p_i}} - \\ldots$$$, where $$$p_i$$$ is the parent of vertex $$$i$$$ on the path to the root (to vertex $$$1$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, in the tree below, vertex $$$4$$$ has the following vertical paths: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4]$$$ with an alternating sum of $$$a_4 = 6$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 3]$$$ with an alternating sum of $$$a_4 - a_3 = 6 - 2 = 4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 3, 2]$$$ with an alternating sum of $$$a_4 - a_3 + a_2 = 6 - 2 + 5 = 9$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 3, 2, 1]$$$ with an alternating sum of $$$a_4 - a_3 + a_2 - a_1 = 6 - 2 + 5 - 4 = 5$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c1d2fb39e30c1f63dd0ebb21484839007a06091ede0f08eea7b44320314824d1.png"},"kind":"image"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"dangers"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the vertices are indicated in red."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Kirei compute the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"threat"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" values for all vertices and escape the estate."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following describes the test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of vertices in the tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$) — the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"dangers"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the vertices."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next $$$n - 1$$$ lines contain the numbers $$$v, u$$$ ($$$1 \\le v, u \\le n$$$, $$$v \\neq u$$$) — the description of the edges of the tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ across all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$. It is also guaranteed that the given set of edges forms a tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output $$$n$$$ integers — the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"threat"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of each vertex."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n5\n4 5 2 6 7\n1 2\n3 2\n4 3\n5 1\n6\n1000000000 500500500 900900900 9 404 800800800\n3 4\n5 1\n2 5\n1 6\n6 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4 5 2 9 7 \n1000000000 1500500096 1701701691 199199209 404 800800800 \n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The tree from the first test case is depicted in the statement, and the maximum "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"variable-sign"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" sums are achieved as follows: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_1 = 4$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_2 = 5$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_3 = 2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_4 - a_3 + a_2 = 6 - 2 + 5 = 9$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_5 = 7$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"2114E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2114/problem/E"}